  <reporting-org ref="NL-KVK-27378529" secondary-reporter="0" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Enterprise Agency</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multidisciplinary production of high quality design furniture in Bosnia and Herzegovina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch furniture market has faced some difficult years with many producers of (semi-finished) products going bankrupt and intensifying competition. At the same time the demand for custom-made furniture, to fit the size and colour requirements of the consumer, is increasing. Due to this trend, supplier flexibility is required, but this is hard to find among present suppliers.The project is located in Tesanj.The applicant, Meubelindustrie Slotboom B.V., designs, produces and sells furniture, i.e. wall systems of lacquered and veneered pressed wood (mainly MDF) panels, under the brand name Interstar. The local partner Nord Ent D.O.O. produces custom-made furniture mainly (90% to 95%) for its Dutch owner Pilat &amp; Pilat (Dutch design brand) and for the applicant. The partners will set up a joint venture.The joint venture will produce custom-made, high quality semi-finished design furniture for the applicant, and finished design furniture for Pilat &amp; Pilat and the local market. The facility will be ISO and FSC certified. This will enable the applicant to strengthen its market position and increase the share of custom-made furniture in its turnover while securing a good part of their total supply of semi-finished products in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
